== Third-party ==
Runtime dependencies of the published packages. None is copied into this repository or bundled into a
published file; each is installed from the registry under its own licence.

@noblecloak/policy-formats
canonicalize 5.1.0 - Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/erdtman/canonicalize
  An RFC 8785 (JSON Canonicalization Scheme) implementation. Writes the canonical form of a policy
  that a round trip compares, and the JSON inside the annotations an export writes.
yaml 2.9.1 - ISC - https://github.com/eemeli/yaml
  Parses AGT manifests on import and detects their format.
